T1  - Design And Implementation Protocol for home blood pressure monitoring in hypertension: a participant-level secondary analysis
JF  - The Lancet Regional Health
PY  - 2024
U3  - Journal Article
Clinical Trial
AB  - this prospective study assessed home blood pressure monitoring for adults with hypertension. Participants will be recruited within a pragmatic network of hospital and community providers; the planned sample is 261 and blood pressure control is the principal endpoint. The protocol prespecifies safety, adherence, and quality-of-life measures and describes procedures for missing observations. The findings should be considered alongside short follow-up and incomplete adherence data. A prespecified sensitivity analysis produced estimates in the same general direction.
