T1  - Secondary analysis of sleep efficiency after brief sleep restriction therapy for insomnia in older adults: a mixed-methods implementation report
JF  - BMJ Open
PY  - 2025
U3  - Journal Article
Clinical Trial
AB  - A prespecified secondary analysis examined variation in sleep efficiency after brief sleep restriction therapy among adults with insomnia in older adults. Effects were explored by baseline severity, age, adherence, and recruitment setting. The pattern was directionally consistent with the primary analysis, but subgroup estimates were imprecise. The analysis also considered differences between hospital and community delivery settings.
